{"parentUuid":"ce013fa1-ab90-4e41-83cf-48f181700a8f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5guvU28k6kdMa5Gns3Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Sy4iXZmL5epwCH85xMKwpv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -f docs/demo/mochi-guide-desktop.mp4 docs/demo/mochi-guide-mobile.mp4 docs/demo/mochi-product-video.mp4 && python3 - <<'E'\nimport re\ns=open('.gitignore').read()\ns=s.replace(\"video/film/desktop/\\n\",\"video/film/desktop/\\nvideo/mochi-film/cap/\\nvideo/mochi-film/audio/\\nvideo/mochi-film/out/\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/assets/s/\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/assets/ad-clip.mp4\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/renders/\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/.hyperframes/\\n\")\nopen('.gitignore','w').write(s)\nr=open('README.md').read()\nr=re.sub(r\"`docs/demo/mochi-guide-desktop.mp4` \\(16:9\\) and `docs/demo/mochi-guide-mobile.mp4` \\(9:16\\) are the ~1 minute guide films \\(source in `video/film/`\\); `docs/demo/mochi-product-video.mp4` is the 45-second product video \\(built with HyperFrames, source in `video/`\\); \",\"`docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4` is the 49-second product film (upload, check, style, generate, share, results; built with HyperFrames, source in `video/mochi-film/`); \",r)\nopen('README.md','w').write(r)\nopen('video/mochi-film/README.md','w').write('''# Mochi product film (49 s, 1920x1080, 60 fps)\n\nProcess guide (upload, check, style, generate, share), features, benefits and results. Built with [HyperFrames](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes).\n\n- `capture.mjs` records clean stills of the real app (the product photos go through the real scan and generation; needs the app running on :3100 and Ollama).\n- `build.py` generates `project/index.html` (HyperFrames composition), `beat-sheet.json` and an original procedural soundtrack (numpy, nothing licensed).\n- All copy on screen comes from the recorded run (`cap/job.json`), not typed by hand. Numbers: 18% to 88% from `docs/RESULTS.md`; the \"s\" counter is the recorded build time.\n\n```bash\nnode capture.mjs && python build.py\ncd project && npm run check && npx hyperframes render --quality delivery --fps 60 -o renders/silent.mp4\n```\nRaw recordings, stills and renders are not committed. Finished film: `docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4`.\n''')\nE\nls docs/demo; git status --short | cut -c1-70; open docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":710404,"cache_read_input_tokens":26554,"output_tokens":1400,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":405},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":710404,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1400,"cache_read_input_tokens":26554,"cache_creation_input_tokens":710404,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":710404},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.131.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.131.content.1","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.134.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.137.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.143.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.146.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.149.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.152.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.