{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"159a4645-4bae-4261-ac0b-464a7f4accd7","hash":"cbe3fb252e9da59d55d2a9b0fbc738a2262305fd85e3ac8c29884f912916690b","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Sy4iXZmL5epwCH85xMKwpv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/advikdivekar/Desktop/sellcraft && rm -f docs/demo/mochi-guide-desktop.mp4 docs/demo/mochi-guide-mobile.mp4 docs/demo/mochi-product-video.mp4 && python3 - <<'E'\nimport re\ns=open('.gitignore').read()\ns=s.replace(\"video/film/desktop/\\n\",\"video/film/desktop/\\nvideo/mochi-film/cap/\\nvideo/mochi-film/audio/\\nvideo/mochi-film/out/\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/assets/s/\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/assets/ad-clip.mp4\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/renders/\\nvideo/mochi-film/project/.hyperframes/\\n\")\nopen('.gitignore','w').write(s)\nr=open('README.md').read()\nr=re.sub(r\"`docs/demo/mochi-guide-desktop.mp4` \\(16:9\\) and `docs/demo/mochi-guide-mobile.mp4` \\(9:16\\) are the ~1 minute guide films \\(source in `video/film/`\\); `docs/demo/mochi-product-video.mp4` is the 45-second product video \\(built with HyperFrames, source in `video/`\\); \",\"`docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4` is the 49-second product film (upload, check, style, generate, share, results; built with HyperFrames, source in `video/mochi-film/`); \",r)\nopen('README.md','w').write(r)\nopen('video/mochi-film/README.md','w').write('''# Mochi product film (49 s, 1920x1080, 60 fps)\n\nProcess guide (upload, check, style, generate, share), features, benefits and results. Built with [HyperFrames](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes).\n\n- `capture.mjs` records clean stills of the real app (the product photos go through the real scan and generation; needs the app running on :3100 and Ollama).\n- `build.py` generates `project/index.html` (HyperFrames composition), `beat-sheet.json` and an original procedural soundtrack (numpy, nothing licensed).\n- All copy on screen comes from the recorded run (`cap/job.json`), not typed by hand. Numbers: 18% to 88% from `docs/RESULTS.md`; the \"s\" counter is the recorded build time.\n\n```bash\nnode capture.mjs && python build.py\ncd project && npm run check && npx hyperframes render --quality delivery --fps 60 -o renders/silent.mp4\n```\nRaw recordings, stills and renders are not committed. Finished film: `docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4`.\n''')\nE\nls docs/demo; git status --short | cut -c1-70; open docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
