{"parentUuid":"32673be6-a6fc-40fc-ab49-7bb2076cd113","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Sy4iXZmL5epwCH85xMKwpv","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"84bf227b-b6c1-46c3-93c8-013ec4bb224f","timestamp":"2026-10-16T09:36:52.323Z","session_id":"d1a90136-ab51-4450-87af-371f07f2f333","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/advikdivekar/Desktop/sellcraft","sessionId":"159a4645-4bae-4261-ac0b-464a7f4accd7","version":"2.1.300","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"84bf227b-b6c1-46c3-93c8-013ec4bb224f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5gxEVYM4cLkG2udrnzN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've made the new film and it's open on your screen, but it's one video, not two. It's 48.8 seconds at 1920×1080 and 60 fps, and it's saved at `docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4` (8 MB).\n\n**What changed from your request:**\n- **One film, not two:** after your note to forget the earlier videos, I made one 16:9 film. If you still want a vertical version for phones, I can recompose it as 9:16.\n- **Your three references:** I took pacing and style from them, not footage. They are references for the look: the calm light canvas and device frames, the red-vs-blue \"why is it still typing\" opener, the mono step menu, big numbers, solid highlight pills, and a brand reveal.\n- **The earlier videos:** I removed the three earlier videos from `docs/demo/` and stopped listing them in the README. The older source folders are still on disk.\n\n**Footage:** instead of cutting your recordings, I re-recorded the real app on its own. I uploaded your five product photos and ran the real scan and generation (Fast mode, 29 s). Everything on screen is from that run: the stills, the real generated copy, the studio photos, the deck and the video ad. Nothing is mocked.\n\n**The film (about 49 s, faster than before):**\n1. **0–7 s:** \"So why is it still four jobs?\" with four to-do cards, then \"One photo. One tap. A whole kit.\" with a five-step menu: Upload, Check, Style, Generate, Share.\n2. **7–17 s:** Upload (reads the label, pre-fills the facts), Check (from photo, check it; blank means flagged), Style (5 platforms, 6 tones, 5 visual styles).\n3. **17–21 s:** Generate, with a live seconds counter beside the real build screen.\n4. **21–33 s:**\n   - Everything in one kit: video ad, 7-slide deck, studio photos, copy for 3 platforms.\n   - A 10-second vertical ad on a phone.\n   - Copy typed out per platform with soft keystroke sounds.\n5. **33–37 s:** \"Nothing made up.\" with the real \"not provided\" panel.\n6. **37–45 s:**\n   - Benefits: runs on your machine, built on open models, no per-kit fees, posts only when you tap.\n   - Results: 18% → 88% clean kits and the 29 s build.\n7. **45–49 s:** the Mochi end card.\n\n**Overlaps:** I rebuilt the layouts with fixed zones, one headline area and one demo area per scene. The checker found no overlaps and all 53 text-contrast checks pass. Scene changes use a quick turquoise wipe.\n\n**Sound:** an original generated soundtrack with a pad, kick, bass and arpeggio, scene whooshes, clicks, keystrokes, a logo bell and a resolving chord. It is loudness-normalised and peaks at −1.2 dB. The file has no black frames.\n\n**Claims in the film:** the results scene carries the footnote \"60 held-out tests · deterministic checker · an independent judge (n=30) shows a smaller gain\". \"No per-kit fees\" refers to the local open-model path only.\n\nTwo things you should know:\n- **Brand name on the product:** the product is a real brand (RASAYANAM). If this goes public, check that you're comfortable showing it. The generated copy only uses facts I typed from the label photos (capsule count, 500 mg, usage), and no health claims.\n- **Not committed:** the new film is untracked. Say \"commit\" if you want it pushed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1494,"cache_read_input_tokens":736958,"output_tokens":1172,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1494,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1172,"cache_read_input_tokens":736958,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1494,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1494},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg5gxDxJeAUadbkV21Rnk","requestRef":"b1aa7f05-fceb-4b63-b2c3-1dc14f4738fb","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c3745f0d-9a7b-47fb-9abd-f21feee59c51","timestamp":"2026-10-16T09:36:52.320Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"d1a90136-ab51-4450-87af-371f07f2f333","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/advikdivekar/Desktop/sellcraft","sessionId":"159a4645-4bae-4261-ac0b-464a7f4accd7","version":"2.1.300","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
