{"parentUuid":"1a538101-1316-4789-b9e9-2b284bfd69e9","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14972668 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c6c414e9-6065-488a-b307-473f3360dea4","timestamp":"2026-10-16T10:41:32.437Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14972668 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"d1a90136-ab51-4450-87af-371f07f2f333","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/advikdivekar/Desktop/sellcraft/video/mochi-film","sessionId":"159a4645-4bae-4261-ac0b-464a7f4accd7","version":"2.1.300","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"c6c414e9-6065-488a-b307-473f3360dea4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5mwLL5jCSibNVgho7ZH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've made all the changes, and the new film is open on your screen: `docs/demo/mochi-product-film.mp4` (52.4 s, 1080p, 60 fps).\n\n## Your changes\n\n- **Intro:** the vague opener is replaced by a direct statement.\n  - It opens with \"Turn one product photo into a complete marketing kit.\" beside your product photo.\n  - Four real outputs from the kit then appear: studio photo, listing copy, social post and video ad.\n  - Then \"Four steps. About 30 seconds.\" with the step menu.\n- **The \"One tap\" frames looping:** that was a real bug. The old scene showed four screenshots taken at different moments against a counter that didn't match them.\n  - I re-recorded a real build with a screenshot about every 0.6 s, 47 frames in total.\n  - The counter and the build screen now move together as one timelapse, labelled \"Real 28 s build, sped up\".\n  - You see 2% → 24% → 40% → 83% → the finished kit.\n  - The Generate step in your film now shows 28 s. The stats scene says 28 s too.\n- **Step-by-step order:** the film now runs in one order and doesn't jump back.\n  1. Intro, then steps 1 to 4 (Upload, Check, Style, Generate), with progress dots.\n  2. Results: the kit, the video ad, the copy, \"Nothing made up\", Share or export.\n  3. Why it matters, the numbers, then the outro.\n- **Share:** the old menu had \"Share\" as step 5 but never showed it before the results. I moved it into the results block, where it belongs.\n\n## Captions\nEach scene's caption is in this table and in two files.\n- `video/mochi-film/captions.md`\n- `docs/demo/mochi-product-film.srt` (a subtitle file with timings)\n\n| # | Time | Caption |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 0:00–0:03.8 | Mochi turns one product photo into a complete marketing kit: studio photos, listing copy, social posts and a 10-second video ad. |\n| 2 | 0:03.8–0:06.8 | Four steps. About 30 seconds. |\n| 3 | 0:06.8–0:10.2 | Step 1, Upload. Add up to five photos of your product. Mochi reads the label and pre-fills the facts. |\n| 4 | 0:10.2–0:13.4 | Step 2, Check. Review what it read. Anything blank is flagged as missing, never guessed. |\n| 5 | 0:13.4–0:16.6 | Step 3, Style. Pick your platforms, tone and visual style. |\n| 6 | 0:16.6–0:21.4 | Step 4, Generate. One tap. Here is a real 28-second build, sped up. |\n| 7 | 0:21.4–0:25.2 | Results. Your kit: a video ad, an image deck, studio photos, and copy for each platform. |\n| 8 | 0:25.2–0:29.2 | A 10-second vertical ad, built from your own photos with real camera moves and text. |\n| 9 | 0:29.2–0:33.6 | Copy for every platform, written from your facts. You edit before you post. |\n| 10 | 0:33.6–0:37.4 | Nothing made up. What you did not tell Mochi is listed as missing, and regulated claims are flagged. |\n| 11 | 0:37.4–0:40.8 | Share or export. Copy a post, download the whole kit, or send a draft to your store. |\n| 12 | 0:40.8–0:44.4 | Why it matters. It runs on your machine, is built on open models, has no per-kit fees, and posts only when you tap. |\n| 13 | 0:44.4–0:48.6 | The numbers. 18% to 88% clean kits on a synthetic test set, and a full kit in about 30 seconds. |\n| 14 | 0:48.6–0:52.4 | Mochi. One photo. A whole marketing kit. |\n\n## Checks\n- **HyperFrames checks:** they pass, with 44 of 44 text-contrast checks.\n- **File checks:** no black frames and the audio peaks at −1.5 dB.\n- **Contact sheet:** I reviewed it for every scene, and the timelapse progresses cleanly with no repeats.\n\nThe captions are a separate subtitle file, not burned into the picture. Say if you want them burned in.\n\nNothing is committed yet. Say \"commit\" and I'll push the film, the `.srt` and the `video/mochi-film/` source."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3381,"cache_read_input_tokens":764864,"output_tokens":1501,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3381,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1501,"cache_read_input_tokens":764864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3381,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3381},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cg5mwKw2aCjngigh9B9rJ","requestRef":"0d07aec7-4fef-4f86-bb95-45e0eaab39fc","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d2c55335-b2e6-423e-873b-085e0530b02d","timestamp":"2026-10-16T10:41:44.640Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"d1a90136-ab51-4450-87af-371f07f2f333","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/advikdivekar/Desktop/sellcraft/video/mochi-film","sessionId":"159a4645-4bae-4261-ac0b-464a7f4accd7","version":"2.1.300","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
